  "duration_s": 469.577007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一百零五岁老人离世，藏在身上的秘密曝光，全网泪崩。刷到这条消息的时候，我愣了好久，原来我们课本里学的长征，真的还有亲历者。刚刚离开二零二六年。七月二十二日凌晨，全国最后一位长征女红军王全英老人走了，享年一百零五岁。很多人说一个时代结束了，可只有了解完她的一生年龄，才知道这个十四岁跟着火把跑出大山的藏族姑娘，用一辈子活成了长征本身。一九二一年，王全英出生在四川阿坝州金山县安宁乡一个贫寒的藏族家庭。那时候他不叫王全英，叫桂香，一岁多父母双亡舅舅把他养到五岁，便送给了当地大户人家。做帮佣说是帮佣，其实就是农奴放牛，放羊，推磨给地主带孩子。最残忍的是，地主曾把他用绳子拴着扔进冰冷刺骨的河水里，来回冲刷一个五六岁的孩子被当成牲口对待。一九三五年，红军长征到达金川十四岁的桂香，第一次见到这支队伍穿的整整齐齐，从不扰民，对村里人和和气气。红军女干部召集群众开会，讲的都是穷人，怎么翻身，他听懂了，跟着几位金川的姐妹，他离开了地主家，投奔了红军。被编入红四方面军，妇女独立团，成为了一名占地卫生员。长征路上，王全英负责护理伤员，筹粮运粮，他不识字，但有个本事，擅长分辨药草。部队缺药时，他总能找到合适的草药，用土筏子救过不少人，但长征的残酷，远不是草药能解决的。过雪山时，冻的实在受不了了，就烤火，可冻伤的地方一烤就化脓，他的左脚小脚趾就是这样，硬生生冻没了。此后，他的左脚只剩下四根脚趾。他的女儿刘桂华回忆，一到下雨天，母亲整个脚背都会疼。这个伤痛跟了他一辈子。一九三六年三月，王全英随部队转战至丹巴县，遭遇了国民党二十四军的围攻。激烈的战斗中，他与大部队失散。为了追赶部队，他和几名同伴翻越雪山，没有鞋穿，踩着深深的积雪前行，靠挖野草、喝雪水冲攻击。一个多月以后，他流落到汶川三江一带，未能走完长征的全程，成了他毕生的遗憾。流落到汶川后王全英隐姓埋名，他从未向人提起长征的经历，与当地村民刘富光成家生育了五个子女，但因条件艰苦，仅有两个女儿存活了下来。一个走过雪山草地冻掉脚趾的女红军，成了一个普通的农村妇女，洗衣做饭、带孩子，像所有那个年代的川西女人一样，日出而作，日落而息。他把那段历史藏了将近五十年。新中国成立后，他给自己改了个名字。王全英全英全天下的红军都是英雄。也有人说，这是为了让牺牲的战友跟着自己一起见证国家的发展。一个不识字的女人，用改名的方式完成了对占友最深沉的承诺。他活着，就是替那些倒在雪山草地上的姐妹们活着。一九八四年，阿坝州人民政府民政局开展流落红军全面排查认定工作，工作人员多方寻访通过。战士们互相回忆和指认的方式，终于找到了这位隐于民间近五十年的老战士童年。阿坝州人民政府为他颁发了流落红军政容书，拿到证明书那一刻，他终于被看见。此后，他先后获得中国工农红军长征胜利八十周年纪念章，庆祝中华人民共和国成立七十周年纪念章，家门口挂上了光荣之家的牌子。二零二二年，一百零一岁的王全英接受了。央视专题片长征之歌摄制组的采访虽然不识字，却能吐字清晰的唱出革命老歌，还能独自行走做针线活。今年的六月二十七日，家人提前为他庆祝了一百零五岁的生日。那天，他穿上了红军的衣服，佩戴上所有的纪念章，那是他最后一次穿那身军装。七月二十二日凌晨的十二三十，王全英在都江堰的家中离世。女儿刘桂华说，母亲走的很安详。在睡梦中离开的家，人均陪伴在侧，唯一的遗憾是没能撑到长征胜利九十周年纪念日。今年正是长征胜利九十周年，他只差不到三个月。刘贵华在朋友圈写道，雪域巾帼踏雪长征隐功仪式初心不改，遵照老人的遗愿，他的遗体将被送回汶川安葬。回到他当年流落成家、隐姓埋名生活过的那片土地。一九三五年，隋红四方面军西渡嘉陵江参加长征的女红军共有八千余人，其中绝大部分是四川人，占长征女红军总人数的百分之九十以上，八千多人走过雪山草地。如今最后一个也走了，有人说一个时代结束了，但更准确的说法是，亲历者离开了，但长征没有结束。那个十四岁从农奴变成红军的小女孩，那个在雪山上冻掉脚趾的卫生员，那个隐姓埋名五十年的普通农妇，那个一百零五岁还穿着红军军装的老人，他用一生证明了一件事儿，有些人活着的每一天都是历史的本身。你看真正的英雄从来都不是站在聚光灯下的，他们可能就是你身边那个普普通通的老人，把轰轰烈烈的过往藏进柴米油盐里，用一辈子守着当年的初心。如果你也被这个隐姓埋名五十年的老红军打动，就点个赞收藏一下，把他的故事转发出去，让更多人知道。还有过这样一位了不起的女战士，也可以在评论区聊聊，你觉得是什么样的信念能支撑一个人隐姓埋名五十年，都不提自己的功劳。我们评论区聊聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1890,
      "text": "一百零五岁老人离世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2310,
      "end_ms": 4230,
      "text": "藏在身上的秘密曝光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4470,
      "end_ms": 5430,
      "text": "全网泪崩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6490,
      "end_ms": 7970,
      "text": "刷到这条消息的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7970,
      "end_ms": 8890,
      "text": "我愣了好久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9570,
      "end_ms": 11710,
      "text": "原来我们课本里学的长征，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11990,
      "end_ms": 13310,
      "text": "真的还有亲历者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13310,
      "end_ms": 15950,
      "text": "刚刚离开二零二六年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16010,
      "end_ms": 17690,
      "text": "七月二十二日凌晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18250,
      "end_ms": 22550,
      "text": "全国最后一位长征女红军王全英老人走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22850,
      "end_ms": 24630,
      "text": "享年一百零五岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25230,
      "end_ms": 27450,
      "text": "很多人说一个时代结束了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27930,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "可只有了解完她的一生年龄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30140,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "才知道这个十四岁跟着火把跑出大山的藏族姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35260,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "用一辈子活成了长征本身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38160,
      "end_ms": 39080,
      "text": "一九二一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39180,
      "end_ms": 45300,
      "text": "王全英出生在四川阿坝州金山县安宁乡一个贫寒的藏族家庭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00018",
      "start_ms": 46139,
      "end_ms": 48360,
      "text": "那时候他不叫王全英，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48600,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "text": "叫桂香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00020",
      "start_ms": 49900,
      "end_ms": 53500,
      "text": "一岁多父母双亡舅舅把他养到五岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53900,
      "end_ms": 56200,
      "text": "便送给了当地大户人家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56200,
      "end_ms": 58240,
      "text": "做帮佣说是帮佣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58620,
      "end_ms": 61270,
      "text": "其实就是农奴放牛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61590,
      "end_ms": 62185,
      "text": "放羊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62530,
      "end_ms": 65175,
      "text": "推磨给地主带孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67430,
      "end_ms": 68470,
      "text": "最残忍的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68470,
      "end_ms": 73690,
      "text": "地主曾把他用绳子拴着扔进冰冷刺骨的河水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00028",
      "start_ms": 73690,
      "end_ms": 78320,
      "text": "来回冲刷一个五六岁的孩子被当成牲口对待。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00029",
      "start_ms": 78440,
      "end_ms": 79440,
      "text": "一九三五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00030",
      "start_ms": 79460,
      "end_ms": 83050,
      "text": "红军长征到达金川十四岁的桂香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83130,
      "end_ms": 86710,
      "text": "第一次见到这支队伍穿的整整齐齐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00032",
      "start_ms": 87010,
      "end_ms": 87975,
      "text": "从不扰民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00033",
      "start_ms": 88670,
      "end_ms": 90635,
      "text": "对村里人和和气气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00034",
      "start_ms": 91080,
      "end_ms": 93805,
      "text": "红军女干部召集群众开会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94380,
      "end_ms": 95540,
      "text": "讲的都是穷人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95540,
      "end_ms": 96335,
      "text": "怎么翻身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96780,
      "end_ms": 97655,
      "text": "他听懂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00038",
      "start_ms": 97900,
      "end_ms": 100075,
      "text": "跟着几位金川的姐妹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100500,
      "end_ms": 102075,
      "text": "他离开了地主家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102470,
      "end_ms": 103715,
      "text": "投奔了红军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00041",
      "start_ms": 104240,
      "end_ms": 106200,
      "text": "被编入红四方面军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00042",
      "start_ms": 106240,
      "end_ms": 107315,
      "text": "妇女独立团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00043",
      "start_ms": 107820,
      "end_ms": 110205,
      "text": "成为了一名占地卫生员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00044",
      "start_ms": 110690,
      "end_ms": 111570,
      "text": "长征路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00045",
      "start_ms": 111590,
      "end_ms": 113475,
      "text": "王全英负责护理伤员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00046",
      "start_ms": 113870,
      "end_ms": 114870,
      "text": "筹粮运粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114970,
      "end_ms": 115785,
      "text": "他不识字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00048",
      "start_ms": 116270,
      "end_ms": 117290,
      "text": "但有个本事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00049",
      "start_ms": 117630,
      "end_ms": 119225,
      "text": "擅长分辨药草。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00050",
      "start_ms": 120160,
      "end_ms": 121120,
      "text": "部队缺药时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00051",
      "start_ms": 121520,
      "end_ms": 124360,
      "text": "他总能找到合适的草药，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00052",
      "start_ms": 124780,
      "end_ms": 127060,
      "text": "用土筏子救过不少人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00053",
      "start_ms": 127900,
      "end_ms": 129500,
      "text": "但长征的残酷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00054",
      "start_ms": 129820,
      "end_ms": 132140,
      "text": "远不是草药能解决的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00055",
      "start_ms": 132560,
      "end_ms": 133580,
      "text": "过雪山时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00056",
      "start_ms": 133960,
      "end_ms": 135440,
      "text": "冻的实在受不了了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00057",
      "start_ms": 135440,
      "end_ms": 136039,
      "text": "就烤火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00058",
      "start_ms": 136580,
      "end_ms": 138960,
      "text": "可冻伤的地方一烤就化脓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00059",
      "start_ms": 139440,
      "end_ms": 141840,
      "text": "他的左脚小脚趾就是这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00060",
      "start_ms": 141960,
      "end_ms": 143500,
      "text": "硬生生冻没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00061",
      "start_ms": 143960,
      "end_ms": 144460,
      "text": "此后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00062",
      "start_ms": 144540,
      "end_ms": 147580,
      "text": "他的左脚只剩下四根脚趾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00063",
      "start_ms": 148040,
      "end_ms": 149735,
      "text": "他的女儿刘桂华回忆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00064",
      "start_ms": 150560,
      "end_ms": 151700,
      "text": "一到下雨天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00065",
      "start_ms": 151980,
      "end_ms": 153980,
      "text": "母亲整个脚背都会疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00066",
      "start_ms": 154460,
      "end_ms": 156320,
      "text": "这个伤痛跟了他一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00067",
      "start_ms": 156420,
      "end_ms": 157980,
      "text": "一九三六年三月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00068",
      "start_ms": 158339,
      "end_ms": 161340,
      "text": "王全英随部队转战至丹巴县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00069",
      "start_ms": 162040,
      "end_ms": 164980,
      "text": "遭遇了国民党二十四军的围攻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00070",
      "start_ms": 165560,
      "end_ms": 166840,
      "text": "激烈的战斗中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00071",
      "start_ms": 167000,
      "end_ms": 168400,
      "text": "他与大部队失散。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00072",
      "start_ms": 169360,
      "end_ms": 170620,
      "text": "为了追赶部队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00073",
      "start_ms": 171040,
      "end_ms": 173420,
      "text": "他和几名同伴翻越雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00074",
      "start_ms": 173740,
      "end_ms": 174680,
      "text": "没有鞋穿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00075",
      "start_ms": 175160,
      "end_ms": 177440,
      "text": "踩着深深的积雪前行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00076",
      "start_ms": 177860,
      "end_ms": 180960,
      "text": "靠挖野草、喝雪水冲攻击。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00077",
      "start_ms": 181530,
      "end_ms": 182605,
      "text": "一个多月以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00078",
      "start_ms": 182960,
      "end_ms": 185365,
      "text": "他流落到汶川三江一带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00079",
      "start_ms": 185840,
      "end_ms": 188215,
      "text": "未能走完长征的全程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00080",
      "start_ms": 188680,
      "end_ms": 190395,
      "text": "成了他毕生的遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00081",
      "start_ms": 191000,
      "end_ms": 194860,
      "text": "流落到汶川后王全英隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00082",
      "start_ms": 195000,
      "end_ms": 197635,
      "text": "他从未向人提起长征的经历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00083",
      "start_ms": 198050,
      "end_ms": 201915,
      "text": "与当地村民刘富光成家生育了五个子女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00084",
      "start_ms": 202850,
      "end_ms": 204245,
      "text": "但因条件艰苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00085",
      "start_ms": 204570,
      "end_ms": 206735,
      "text": "仅有两个女儿存活了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00086",
      "start_ms": 207840,
      "end_ms": 211845,
      "text": "一个走过雪山草地冻掉脚趾的女红军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00087",
      "start_ms": 212130,
      "end_ms": 214605,
      "text": "成了一个普通的农村妇女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00088",
      "start_ms": 215000,
      "end_ms": 216675,
      "text": "洗衣做饭、带孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00089",
      "start_ms": 217160,
      "end_ms": 219915,
      "text": "像所有那个年代的川西女人一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00090",
      "start_ms": 220330,
      "end_ms": 221250,
      "text": "日出而作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00091",
      "start_ms": 221450,
      "end_ms": 222465,
      "text": "日落而息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00092",
      "start_ms": 223250,
      "end_ms": 225735,
      "text": "他把那段历史藏了将近五十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00093",
      "start_ms": 226190,
      "end_ms": 227535,
      "text": "新中国成立后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00094",
      "start_ms": 227860,
      "end_ms": 229360,
      "text": "他给自己改了个名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00095",
      "start_ms": 229580,
      "end_ms": 233735,
      "text": "王全英全英全天下的红军都是英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00096",
      "start_ms": 234590,
      "end_ms": 235475,
      "text": "也有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00097",
      "start_ms": 235940,
      "end_ms": 240285,
      "text": "这是为了让牺牲的战友跟着自己一起见证国家的发展。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00098",
      "start_ms": 241290,
      "end_ms": 243005,
      "text": "一个不识字的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00099",
      "start_ms": 243440,
      "end_ms": 248885,
      "text": "用改名的方式完成了对占友最深沉的承诺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00100",
      "start_ms": 249450,
      "end_ms": 249990,
      "text": "他活着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00101",
      "start_ms": 249990,
      "end_ms": 253285,
      "text": "就是替那些倒在雪山草地上的姐妹们活着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00102",
      "start_ms": 254270,
      "end_ms": 255125,
      "text": "一九八四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00103",
      "start_ms": 255390,
      "end_ms": 261355,
      "text": "阿坝州人民政府民政局开展流落红军全面排查认定工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00104",
      "start_ms": 261810,
      "end_ms": 265160,
      "text": "工作人员多方寻访通过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00105",
      "start_ms": 265460,
      "end_ms": 268740,
      "text": "战士们互相回忆和指认的方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00106",
      "start_ms": 268880,
      "end_ms": 274560,
      "text": "终于找到了这位隐于民间近五十年的老战士童年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00107",
      "start_ms": 274860,
      "end_ms": 279045,
      "text": "阿坝州人民政府为他颁发了流落红军政容书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00108",
      "start_ms": 279770,
      "end_ms": 281190,
      "text": "拿到证明书那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00109",
      "start_ms": 281450,
      "end_ms": 282785,
      "text": "他终于被看见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00110",
      "start_ms": 283370,
      "end_ms": 283790,
      "text": "此后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00111",
      "start_ms": 283790,
      "end_ms": 288805,
      "text": "他先后获得中国工农红军长征胜利八十周年纪念章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00112",
      "start_ms": 289410,
      "end_ms": 293245,
      "text": "庆祝中华人民共和国成立七十周年纪念章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00113",
      "start_ms": 293890,
      "end_ms": 296805,
      "text": "家门口挂上了光荣之家的牌子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00114",
      "start_ms": 297430,
      "end_ms": 298470,
      "text": "二零二二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00115",
      "start_ms": 298470,
      "end_ms": 301115,
      "text": "一百零一岁的王全英接受了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00116",
      "start_ms": 301490,
      "end_ms": 306190,
      "text": "央视专题片长征之歌摄制组的采访虽然不识字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00117",
      "start_ms": 306450,
      "end_ms": 309610,
      "text": "却能吐字清晰的唱出革命老歌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00118",
      "start_ms": 309850,
      "end_ms": 312530,
      "text": "还能独自行走做针线活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00119",
      "start_ms": 313330,
      "end_ms": 314950,
      "text": "今年的六月二十七日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00120",
      "start_ms": 314950,
      "end_ms": 318210,
      "text": "家人提前为他庆祝了一百零五岁的生日。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00121",
      "start_ms": 318870,
      "end_ms": 319230,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00122",
      "start_ms": 319230,
      "end_ms": 320790,
      "text": "他穿上了红军的衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00123",
      "start_ms": 321230,
      "end_ms": 322890,
      "text": "佩戴上所有的纪念章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00124",
      "start_ms": 323590,
      "end_ms": 326410,
      "text": "那是他最后一次穿那身军装。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00125",
      "start_ms": 327230,
      "end_ms": 330850,
      "text": "七月二十二日凌晨的十二三十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00126",
      "start_ms": 331560,
      "end_ms": 334940,
      "text": "王全英在都江堰的家中离世。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00127",
      "start_ms": 335560,
      "end_ms": 336800,
      "text": "女儿刘桂华说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00128",
      "start_ms": 337220,
      "end_ms": 338840,
      "text": "母亲走的很安详。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00129",
      "start_ms": 339380,
      "end_ms": 341720,
      "text": "在睡梦中离开的家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00130",
      "start_ms": 341820,
      "end_ms": 343800,
      "text": "人均陪伴在侧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00131",
      "start_ms": 344040,
      "end_ms": 348520,
      "text": "唯一的遗憾是没能撑到长征胜利九十周年纪念日。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00132",
      "start_ms": 349460,
      "end_ms": 352300,
      "text": "今年正是长征胜利九十周年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00133",
      "start_ms": 352960,
      "end_ms": 354680,
      "text": "他只差不到三个月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00134",
      "start_ms": 356460,
      "end_ms": 358280,
      "text": "刘贵华在朋友圈写道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00135",
      "start_ms": 358760,
      "end_ms": 363815,
      "text": "雪域巾帼踏雪长征隐功仪式初心不改，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00136",
      "start_ms": 364280,
      "end_ms": 365820,
      "text": "遵照老人的遗愿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00137",
      "start_ms": 366120,
      "end_ms": 369445,
      "text": "他的遗体将被送回汶川安葬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00138",
      "start_ms": 370250,
      "end_ms": 375855,
      "text": "回到他当年流落成家、隐姓埋名生活过的那片土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00139",
      "start_ms": 376490,
      "end_ms": 377655,
      "text": "一九三五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00140",
      "start_ms": 378000,
      "end_ms": 383430,
      "text": "隋红四方面军西渡嘉陵江参加长征的女红军共有八千余人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00141",
      "start_ms": 383430,
      "end_ms": 385555,
      "text": "其中绝大部分是四川人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00142",
      "start_ms": 385910,
      "end_ms": 389935,
      "text": "占长征女红军总人数的百分之九十以上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00143",
      "start_ms": 390620,
      "end_ms": 392785,
      "text": "八千多人走过雪山草地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00144",
      "start_ms": 393470,
      "end_ms": 395115,
      "text": "如今最后一个也走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00145",
      "start_ms": 395740,
      "end_ms": 397665,
      "text": "有人说一个时代结束了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00146",
      "start_ms": 398190,
      "end_ms": 399885,
      "text": "但更准确的说法是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00147",
      "start_ms": 400390,
      "end_ms": 401875,
      "text": "亲历者离开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00148",
      "start_ms": 402090,
      "end_ms": 403735,
      "text": "但长征没有结束。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00149",
      "start_ms": 404230,
      "end_ms": 407715,
      "text": "那个十四岁从农奴变成红军的小女孩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00150",
      "start_ms": 408210,
      "end_ms": 411065,
      "text": "那个在雪山上冻掉脚趾的卫生员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00151",
      "start_ms": 411680,
      "end_ms": 414835,
      "text": "那个隐姓埋名五十年的普通农妇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00152",
      "start_ms": 415450,
      "end_ms": 418490,
      "text": "那个一百零五岁还穿着红军军装的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00153",
      "start_ms": 418630,
      "end_ms": 420565,
      "text": "他用一生证明了一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00154",
      "start_ms": 421110,
      "end_ms": 424845,
      "text": "有些人活着的每一天都是历史的本身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00155",
      "start_ms": 425310,
      "end_ms": 430215,
      "text": "你看真正的英雄从来都不是站在聚光灯下的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00156",
      "start_ms": 431120,
      "end_ms": 434635,
      "text": "他们可能就是你身边那个普普通通的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00157",
      "start_ms": 435290,
      "end_ms": 438815,
      "text": "把轰轰烈烈的过往藏进柴米油盐里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00158",
      "start_ms": 439130,
      "end_ms": 441815,
      "text": "用一辈子守着当年的初心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00159",
      "start_ms": 442560,
      "end_ms": 446260,
      "text": "如果你也被这个隐姓埋名五十年的老红军打动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00160",
      "start_ms": 446540,
      "end_ms": 448395,
      "text": "就点个赞收藏一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00161",
      "start_ms": 448990,
      "end_ms": 450985,
      "text": "把他的故事转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00162",
      "start_ms": 451470,
      "end_ms": 452730,
      "text": "让更多人知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00163",
      "start_ms": 452910,
      "end_ms": 455810,
      "text": "还有过这样一位了不起的女战士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f80e9c7bc712ea91_s00164",
      "start_ms": 455890,
      "end_ms": 457465,
